    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d868">

                <pb facs="1146" n="1136" sameAs="frus:frus1946v10/pg1136"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">123 Chase, Augustus: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Consul General at Tientsin</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Myers</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1946-03-12T13:00:00-05:00">March 12, 1946—1
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>40. For Chase. Referring your assignment to reestablish Consulate General Mukden,
                    China notify Dept by telegram date arrival Mukden which will be considered date
                    reestablishment of office and date office opened to public,<anchor n="19"
                        xml:id="d868-f1"/> which will be earliest practicable date after location
                    office quarters and installation necessary equipment. Detailed instructions will
                    be forwarded by air mail.</p>
                <p>Obtain from Shanghai stockpile such supplies as needed, later requisitioning from
                    Department needed equipment or furniture not available from Shanghai.</p>
                <p>Office Mukden is authorized to perform all the usual consular services after
                    opening to public including all citizenship services (including the issuance of
                    passports) and all visa services.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Byrnes</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d868-f1" n="19" xml:id="d868-f1-content">
                <p>The Mukden office was opened to the public on March 27.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
